 out here, but I'm still struggling with the Mekhet.<br /> Daeva: A Smaller God (Darling Violetta)<br /> Gangrel: Beast Within (In This Moment)<br /> Nosferatu: Rotting on the Vine (Kristeen Young) - Took this from the Succubus Club, as I couldn't find anything better.<br /> Ventrue: Princes of the Universe (Queen) - I don't know to what degree this works for the Ventrue, but it's still awesome.<br /> -<br /> -<br /> As for Covenants, I've got some, but still searching for stuff.<br /> Circle of the Crone: Mother Earth, Father Thunder (Bathory)<br /> Lancea Et Sanctum: Blood On My Name (The Brothers Bright - I also use 'Hail the Nightmare' from Bloodborne for the Monachal Creed.<br /> Ordo Dracul: Homeostasis (Nostalghia)<br /> -","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T15:10:13-07:00","id":1213911,"title":"","content":"Lancea et Sanctum:<br /> Hozier - Take me to church<br /> The White Buffalo - The Whistler<br /> Johnny Cash - God's Gonna Cut You Down<br /> <br /> Carthian Movement<br /> Kasabian - Underdog<br /> Genitorturers - Revolution<br /> <br /> The two above are kind of the easiet to find music to imho, any punk or omnious religious music will do.<br /> <br /> Invictus<br /> Frank Sinatra - The Best Is Yet To Come (just stay loyal for a few more decades and then I promise you'll reap the rewards!)<br /> Camille Saint-Sa\u00ebns - Danse Macabre<br /> <br /> Daeva<br /> Jack White - Would You Fight For My Love?<br /> <br /> Ventrue<br /> Paul Stanley - Live to Win (if South Park hasn't ruined it 